		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:prsjlcqmyr3unqje5g6gzbxw/app.bsky.feed.post/3m4iujiwkuc2t",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:hewhabm3uw73cbz27uwuydcg/app.bsky.feed.post/3m4ii4gbav224",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/engelman.nl/post/3m4iujiwkuc2t",
			"author": {
				"name": "Danny Engelman 🌷🏍️🛥️",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/engelman.nl",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:prsjlcqmyr3unqje5g6gzbxw/bafkreicmgiut2fprnqwxl77xndpf3jcrftazwaurgpy7lqotoz7b46qjne"
			},
			"date": "2025-10-31T16:11:40.253Z",
			"content": "<p>Its a choice to put every fork in its own drawer/slot WITHOUT a label</p>\n<p>Maybe a tile based border-less boardgame? <br>\nNot chess, because you want &lt;slot&gt; NAMED A1-H8<br>\nCould Carcassonne be a good example? Dominos?</p>\n<p>Performance wise its (just) DOM;<br>\n1000 (list)items need 1000 &lt;slots&gt; 999 not really required</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:prsjlcqmyr3unqje5g6gzbxw/app.bsky.feed.post/3m4ivjrrloc2t",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:prsjlcqmyr3unqje5g6gzbxw/app.bsky.feed.post/3m4iujiwkuc2t",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/engelman.nl/post/3m4ivjrrloc2t",
			"author": {
				"name": "Danny Engelman 🌷🏍️🛥️",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/engelman.nl",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:prsjlcqmyr3unqje5g6gzbxw/bafkreicmgiut2fprnqwxl77xndpf3jcrftazwaurgpy7lqotoz7b46qjne"
			},
			"date": "2025-10-31T16:29:43.266Z",
			"content": "<p>Carcassonne is easier with a rotating fixed size square layout in a CSS grid, where rows and columns are added Top-Bottom-Left-Right</p>\n<p>Dominos probably requires masonry (not supported in a browser yet)</p>\n<p>Maybe next weeks team Web Component challenge; we did Ludo once; all NAMED slots and CSS grid-area</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:mvzxcopxl7477vdjw6fqutgh/app.bsky.feed.post/3m4julpknqk2z",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:hewhabm3uw73cbz27uwuydcg/app.bsky.feed.post/3m4gepfdqes27",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/elfsternberg.bsky.social/post/3m4julpknqk2z",
			"author": {
				"name": "Elf M. Sternberg",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/elfsternberg.bsky.social",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:mvzxcopxl7477vdjw6fqutgh/bafkreigkz26xe3uwbfdnlirqioqjsyreehat5cj23o2ivzgkzfkbf2nbrq"
			},
			"date": "2025-11-01T01:45:34.050Z",
			"content": "<p>We have a number of components in our library that \"autoslot.\" They look at the \"shape\" of the light DOM and, where it conforms, will generate a template AND assign slot names. That works well for things like input wrappers (label, help, etc), lists, and description lists.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:mvzxcopxl7477vdjw6fqutgh/app.bsky.feed.post/3m4k6vtll6c2z",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:mvzxcopxl7477vdjw6fqutgh/app.bsky.feed.post/3m4julpknqk2z",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/elfsternberg.bsky.social/post/3m4k6vtll6c2z",
			"author": {
				"name": "Elf M. Sternberg",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/elfsternberg.bsky.social",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:mvzxcopxl7477vdjw6fqutgh/bafkreigkz26xe3uwbfdnlirqioqjsyreehat5cj23o2ivzgkzfkbf2nbrq"
			},
			"date": "2025-11-01T04:50:11.238Z",
			"content": "<p>The idea is that, like other composite components like select/option, or details/summary, you shouldn't have to provide slot attributes when the meaning of the lightDOM content is conformant and contextually clear.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
